<!-- ============ 11 FÓRMULAS ============ -->
<section id="formulas">
<h2><span class="num">11</span>Hoja de fórmulas</h2>
<p class="nota">Notación: $\ell_1=\ell_1(P,\vec v)$, $\ell_2=\ell_2(Q,\vec w)$, $\overrightarrow{PQ}=Q-P$. Las filas marcadas son del adelanto.</p>
<div class="tabla"><table>
<thead><tr><th>Concepto</th><th>Fórmula</th><th></th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Recta, vectorial</td><td>$X=P+t\,\vec v,\;t\in\mathbb{R}$</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Recta, paramétricas</td><td>$x=p_1+tv_1,\;y=p_2+tv_2,\;z=p_3+tv_3$</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Recta, simétricas</td><td>$\dfrac{x-p_1}{v_1}=\dfrac{y-p_2}{v_2}=\dfrac{z-p_3}{v_3}$</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Rectas paralelas</td><td>$\vec v=\alpha\vec w\iff\vec v\times\vec w=\vec 0$</td><td></td></tr>
